#: src/postulo/plugins/gdpr/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Data protection"
msgstr "Protecziun da datas"

#: src/postulo/plugins/gdpr/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The data the instance keeps about other people: what it holds on one contact, asked in one document, the erasure of one that says what it removed, a retention policy with a dry run that deletes nothing, the record of what the instance processes and who receives it, and the instance's own privacy notice. Switched off, the site offers none of these pages; nothing is deleted, because a switch is not a deletion."
msgstr "Las datas che l'instanza conserva davart autras persunas: las datas ch'ella ha davart in contact, dumandadas en in document, l'eliminaziun d'in contact che di tge ch'ella ha allontanà, ina directiva da conservaziun cun ina simulaziun che na stizza nagut, il register da quai che l'instanza elavurescha e da tgi che retschaiva quai, e la decleraziun da protecziun da datas da l'instanza sezza. Deactivà, na porscha la website nagina da questas paginas; nagut na vegn stizzà, perquai ch'ina deactivaziun n'è nagin stizzar."
